5,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Hi everyone! I'm Sakura! This game sounds like a super fun mystery, doesn't it? I wonder who the big bad wolf is! Let's all be honest... or maybe not! Teehee!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minako,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. Let's keep a cool head. To find the werewolf, we should observe everyone's speech patterns and look for any inconsistencies in their logic as the days progress.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree with Minako. Emotional reactions can be misleading, so focusing on logical consistency and behavioral baselines is the most rational approach. I will be observing how everyone's claims evolve over the next few turns.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm Takumi! I don't care about all that fancy logic stuff, but I'll help find the wolf. I'll trust my gut and follow whoever seems like they actually know what they're doing. Let's just get this started!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Misaki,,Hello. I agree with Minako and Victoria. Let's stay calm and observe. I'll be watching for any contradictions in our conversations to help identify the werewolf.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Sakura,,@Minako @Victoria @Misaki You guys are so serious! It's like being in a classroom! Maybe the wolf is someone who tries *too* hard to sound smart? Just a silly thought! Teehee!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Victoria"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minako,,"@Sakura, while a playful approach is fine, we cannot rely on intuition alone. The werewolf will likely try to blend in or deflect suspicion. Establishing a clear baseline of behavior now will make anomalies easier to spot later.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, your suggestion is an interesting perspective, but ""trying to sound smart"" is subjective. I am more interested in whether a player's logic remains consistent or shifts when they are pressured. That is a more reliable metric.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Sakura, you might be onto something! Sometimes the people who talk the most about ""logic"" are just trying to hide something. I'll keep an eye on everyone. Who do you guys think is acting the weirdest so far?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Misaki,,It's too early to say who is acting weird. We've only spoken a few times. I think we should continue observing everyone's natural way of speaking before we start making accusations.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Takumi You're so funny! I like how you think! Maybe we should play a game of ""I Spy"" to see who's nervous? Just kidding! I'm just so excited to see who the wolf is! Teehee!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minako,,"@Sakura, let's avoid distractions. While your energy is noted, we should focus on the structure of our discussion. I suggest we all clearly state our initial thoughts on how to handle the first vote tomorrow.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Minako, I agree. We should decide if we will prioritize the Seer's potential information or look for behavioral anomalies. If someone claims to be the Seer tomorrow, we must carefully analyze if their ""revelation"" serves a logical purpose or is a diversion.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Victoria, that sounds way too complicated. If someone says they're the Seer and they've got proof, I'm with them. Let's just see who's acting shifty tomorrow and get rid of the wolf!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Misaki,,I think we should be cautious about trusting a Seer claim immediately. The werewolf or the Possessed could easily fake it to mislead us. We should compare their information with our own observations.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Sakura,,@Misaki You're so cautious! It's almost scary! But maybe the wolf is just someone who's really good at pretending to be a goody-two-shoes? I'm just gonna have fun and see what happens! Good luck everyone! Teehee!,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Minako,,"Let us conclude today's discussion here. We have established our general approaches. Tomorrow, we must be vigilant and prioritize factual consistency over intuition. I look forward to seeing how everyone's behavior evolves. Good night.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Victoria,,"I will be paying close attention to the transition between today's baselines and tomorrow's claims. Any sudden shift in tone or logic will be a significant red flag. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm done talking for today! I'll just trust my instincts tomorrow. If someone looks shifty, I'm calling them out! Good night, everyone!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Misaki,,I agree. Let's see what information comes to light tomorrow. I'll be paying attention to everyone's reactions. Good night.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
