31,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Good morning everyone! Did you all have sweet dreams? I wonder if the Seer found something super juicy last night! I'm just dying to know who's the wolf! Teehee!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Minako,,"@Sakura, let's stay focused. I have information from my divination, but revealing it too early can make the Seer a target for the werewolf. For now, I want to see if anyone else claims the role.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Minako, claiming the Seer role so early is a bold move. If you are indeed the Seer, revealing your identity now risks your life tonight. I wonder if this is a strategic choice or a calculated risk.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Minako, you're the Seer? That's awesome! I told you guys I'd follow whoever knows what's going on. Just tell us who the wolf is already so we can kick them out!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Minako, claiming the Seer role this early is quite risky. As Victoria mentioned, it makes you a target. I wonder if you're the real Seer or if you're trying to seize control of the conversation.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Minako Wow, you're the Seer! That's so cool! But @Victoria and @Misaki are right, it's super risky! Are you trying to be a hero, or are you just playing a trick on us? Teehee!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Victoria"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Victoria @Misaki, my goal is to lead the village to victory efficiently. By establishing my role now, I can guide the discussion based on facts. I have already confirmed that Takumi is human.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Misaki"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Minako, confirming Takumi as human is a safe piece of information, but it doesn't immediately narrow down the wolf. I'm analyzing whether this specific revelation is intended to gain Takumi's trust and secure an ally.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Minako Thanks for having my back! See, I told you guys I'd follow the person who knows what's happening. Since Minako says I'm human, I trust her. Let's just listen to her and find that wolf!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Minako, confirming Takumi is human is helpful, but it doesn't prove you're the Seer. A werewolf could easily claim the role and ""clear"" a villager to gain their trust. We should remain skeptical until more evidence appears.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Misaki You're always so suspicious! It's like a detective movie! But @Minako, if you're the Seer, who else did you look at? Or is it a secret? I bet the wolf is shaking in their boots! Teehee!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Sakura, I can only divine one person per night. I chose Takumi to establish a baseline of trust. Now, I want to see if anyone else attempts to claim the Seer role to contradict me.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Minako, your logic is consistent, but the strategy of ""establishing trust"" is a double-edged sword. It works for a Seer, but it is also the ideal play for a Werewolf seeking a loyal shield in Takumi. Does anyone else claim the Seer role?","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Victoria, stop overthinking it! Minako was honest about being the Seer right away. I'm sticking with her. If anyone else tries to say they're the Seer now, they're definitely lying! Who's it gonna be?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi, your trust is a bit too hasty. @Victoria is right; this is a classic strategy for a werewolf to secure a protector. @Minako, if you are the Seer, why not tell us your plan for tonight's divination?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Victoria"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Misaki You're so serious! It's like you're trying to catch us in a trap! @Minako, tell us your secret plan! I bet it's super mysterious! I'm just gonna vote for whoever looks the most nervous! Teehee!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Minako,,"@Misaki, my plan is to divine one of the remaining players to narrow down the suspects. Since Takumi is human, the wolf is among Sakura, Victoria, or you. I will use tonight to further clarify the truth.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Takumi"",""Sakura"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
